  "title": "McNamara&#39;s Irish Soda Bread",
  "description": "A sweet Irish soda bread sprinkled with raw crystal sugar makes a great treat with a cup of tea or as a light dessert. Eat it warm with butter.",
  "authors": [
    "Cmcnamara623"
  ],
